sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer as Customer / Provider Browser
    participant React as React SPA (AuthContext)
    participant Filter as JwtAuthenticationFilter
    participant SecContext as SecurityContextHolder
    participant Controller as Spring Boot REST Controller
    participant Service as Business Service (Ownership Check)

    Customer->>React: Click Protected Action (e.g. Hold Seats / Add Theatre)
    React->>Filter: HTTP Request + Header (Authorization: Bearer <token>)
    Filter->>Filter: Validate JWT Signature & Expiration
    alt Token Valid
        Filter->>SecContext: Set Authentication (UserPrincipal + Authorities)
        Filter->>Controller: Dispatch Request
        Controller->>Service: Execute Business Method
        Service->>Service: Enforce Provider Resource Ownership (theatre.owner_user_id)
        Service-->>React: Return ApiResponse (SUCCESS)
    else Token Missing or Invalid
        Filter-->>React: HTTP 401 Unauthorized
    else Insufficient Role Authority
        SecContext-->>React: HTTP 403 Forbidden
    end
